// The route search's fastest runs of The Aviary (design.md, "The agent loop"): any% and
// 100%, tool-assisted, and the same human-possible: each input has slack, and a slip of a tick
// or two is recoverable within a second (route/slack.wrela; route/tests.wrela checks them for
// it). No person has played them. `wrela tool route -- --level aviary` searches for better ones
// and writes this file again, with the tests' times; run it again when a change to the movement
// or the course moves them.

use course::{AVIARY, course}
use pad::{DOWN, Hold, JUMP, LEFT, PRESS, RIGHT, UP, hold}
use world::play

